WEBVTT

00:06.540 --> 00:08.790
Look! I drew you, Aria!

00:09.130 --> 00:10.630
I don't want me!

00:10.630 --> 00:11.830
Draw Meria instead!

00:12.080 --> 00:14.960
Aww, but I worked hard on that...

00:15.500 --> 00:21.250
You know she'd much rather get a picture of
her favorite character from your manga.

00:21.250 --> 00:24.170
She's VB's biggest fan, after all.

00:24.170 --> 00:25.290
Mami!

00:25.710 --> 00:27.670
You've still got lots of copies left.

00:27.670 --> 00:29.380
Go sign a few more for her.

00:30.130 --> 00:31.630
Why bother?

00:31.630 --> 00:33.710
It got canceled because
no one was reading it.

00:34.080 --> 00:37.750
Do you think she cares about that? Hmm?

00:37.750 --> 00:39.040
It's so cool!

00:41.080 --> 00:44.420
I loved my dad and his manga.

00:45.580 --> 00:46.670
But...

00:47.580 --> 00:50.130
When are you actually going
to get published again?

00:51.080 --> 00:54.290
You've told me a thousand times
"this next meeting is the one!"

00:54.710 --> 00:56.790
But it's a year later,
and we're still here!

00:57.540 --> 01:00.790
That last one got shot down.

01:00.790 --> 01:03.380
I'm working on something new now.

01:03.790 --> 01:04.790
What?!

01:04.790 --> 01:06.830
Why didn't you bother telling me that?!

01:06.830 --> 01:09.790
It wouldn't have meant anything to you.

01:09.790 --> 01:12.040
It means something when I'm paying the bills!

01:16.080 --> 01:19.460
Long story short,
he just couldn't get published again,

01:19.460 --> 01:21.790
and they got divorced when I was six.

01:23.750 --> 01:25.830
I get why my mom left him.

01:25.830 --> 01:31.380
The last thing I remember about
my dad was his obsession with work.

01:32.250 --> 01:36.630
So, I'm not bothered they got divorced.
Mom and Dad had their reasons.

01:38.000 --> 01:40.420
What bothers me is the last
words we said to each other...

01:41.630 --> 01:43.290
...were said in anger.

01:45.080 --> 01:47.670
Why are you reading my manga?

01:47.670 --> 01:49.580
Don't you know it's horrible?!

01:49.830 --> 01:51.210
Give it back!

01:51.630 --> 01:53.920
You don't get it, Aria.

01:54.380 --> 01:58.830
Everyone says this manga is trash.

01:58.830 --> 02:03.460
Everyone pointed and
laughed at how awful it was!

02:03.460 --> 02:06.290
How no one should ever bother with it!

02:06.830 --> 02:08.630
Everyone said it.

02:08.960 --> 02:13.460
The editorial team agreed...

02:13.750 --> 02:15.210
That was that.

02:15.210 --> 02:19.380
This book is the proof I'm a hack job manga-ka!

02:19.380 --> 02:21.330
This stupid book is the reason...

02:21.630 --> 02:24.080
...that my career is dead!

02:31.000 --> 02:32.380
You...

02:32.710 --> 02:36.170
I hate you, and I hate your stupid manga!

02:42.500 --> 02:47.750
I couldn't have known that was
the day my dad was leaving us.

04:19.920 --> 04:24.880
<b>Comrades in (Cosplay) Arms</b>

04:25.500 --> 04:30.750
It's been ten years since he left.
Mom says she doesn't know what he's up to.

04:31.250 --> 04:33.880
Though I can bet he probably quit working on manga.

04:35.040 --> 04:41.330
I would've never guessed Aria's dad was
the creator of Valkyrie Battle, Yo Kisaki...

04:42.210 --> 04:44.750
I've always wanted to apologize for what I said.

04:45.380 --> 04:47.210
And I want him to apologize, too.

04:47.540 --> 04:51.040
So you're doing this to find Kisaki-sensei...
I mean, your dad?

04:51.960 --> 04:55.080
I have no idea where he is or what he's up to.

04:55.080 --> 05:01.210
So if I got famous, he'd see me,
but my dad doesn't watch TV or read magazines.

05:02.000 --> 05:04.710
But, if I wore a cosplay from
a manga he created,

05:04.710 --> 05:07.380
he'd have to hear about me!

05:08.920 --> 05:12.000
I thought about hiring a private investigator,

05:12.000 --> 05:14.380
but I wasn't sure what
I'd do when I found him.

05:12.000 --> 05:14.380
<b>Private Investigator</b>

05:14.630 --> 05:17.130
I don't feel like having that talk with him right now.

05:20.880 --> 05:25.040
But there's one thing I want to tell him,
more than anything.

05:25.960 --> 05:31.830
I want to tell the creator of Valkyrie Battle
how much I really love his manga.

05:33.540 --> 05:39.330
Because I'm not just his daughter.
I'm a reader and a fan of his manga.

05:40.210 --> 05:43.830
You want to show the creator
how much you love his work?

05:44.710 --> 05:50.210
I never needed to teach
you anything about cosplay.

05:50.580 --> 05:53.540
You already know what cosplay is!

05:53.920 --> 05:55.210
Ririsa...

05:56.500 --> 06:00.380
I've got nothing to teach you, Aria-chan!

06:03.040 --> 06:04.040
We'll help!

06:04.290 --> 06:08.670
You want to get super famous, right?!
We can help!

06:08.670 --> 06:09.790
Nono-pi...

06:10.710 --> 06:16.000
First you have to get famous,
then you can do a VB cosplay, yeah?

06:16.330 --> 06:18.080
What event should we target?

06:18.080 --> 06:22.210
If we're doing Ariel,
maybe we should aim for July?

06:22.210 --> 06:23.290
August?

06:24.750 --> 06:27.830
Please! We've gotta do it for Summer Comiket!

06:30.460 --> 06:31.880
Summer Comiket?!

06:33.580 --> 06:37.750
So, everyone's kinda freaking out...
Is that a big deal?

06:37.750 --> 06:39.500
You haven't heard of Summer Comiket?!

06:39.500 --> 06:43.040
It's the biggest event of the year!
Seven hundred thousand people go there!

06:43.460 --> 06:45.540
Seven hundred thousand?

06:45.540 --> 06:47.500
O-okay...

06:47.500 --> 06:53.000
If I post that Liliel and I are doing
the Angelic Airborne Defense Squadron...

06:53.000 --> 06:55.540
Wait a second...

06:56.330 --> 06:58.830
We're gonna need one more person!

06:58.830 --> 07:01.040
Everyone will think we'll be a group of four!

07:01.460 --> 07:03.290
Oh, the girl with the black hair.

07:03.290 --> 07:06.130
The one who kinda came out of nowhere, honestly...

07:07.130 --> 07:10.250
It seems like that in the spinoff!

07:10.250 --> 07:13.830
She's actually a super popular
character from the original!

07:14.540 --> 07:16.630
Should we start looking for our fourth?

07:16.630 --> 07:23.130
So actually, I had this thought when
we were discussing plans earlier.

07:23.130 --> 07:25.750
She should be coming today, too.

07:25.750 --> 07:26.580
Huh?

07:28.500 --> 07:30.000
Senpai!

07:30.000 --> 07:33.130
Guess whose modeling work's
going on hiatus for a little bit?

07:33.130 --> 07:34.960
Wait, who are all these other girls?!

07:35.290 --> 07:36.920
M-M-Mi...

07:37.630 --> 07:38.920
What?

07:38.920 --> 07:41.790
Why do I have a bad feeling about this?

07:41.960 --> 07:42.790
Mikarin?!

07:42.790 --> 07:44.040
You wanna introduce yourself?!

07:44.040 --> 07:46.580
Ohmigod, I'm such a huge fan!

07:47.210 --> 07:48.580
Wait, you're a fan?

07:48.580 --> 07:52.330
I'm Aria! I follow your Insta,
and I always read your interviews!

07:53.460 --> 07:57.130
Wow, Mikari, you really are famous.
This is so cool.

07:59.130 --> 08:00.960
Thanks, Aria-chan.

08:00.960 --> 08:03.830
Want an autograph?
Thanks for all the support.

08:03.830 --> 08:06.080
Ohmigod, you're gorgeous...

08:06.880 --> 08:08.210
Yay!

08:09.080 --> 08:10.630
So... Who is she?

08:10.630 --> 08:13.790
You don't know Mikarin?! She's a huge model!

08:14.170 --> 08:19.630
Weren't you the one who told me
to be a model to get famous?

08:19.630 --> 08:23.750
So... Maybe your original plan was the right choice.

08:25.630 --> 08:28.710
Okay, I understand what's up now.

08:28.710 --> 08:31.420
Okumura and Mikarin were
friends when they were kids?!

08:31.790 --> 08:35.710
So you need me to be your fourth member.

08:36.130 --> 08:39.750
Sure, but even if you're friends with Ririsa,
there's no way you'd actually do it, right?

08:39.750 --> 08:43.040
If Senpai asked, I'd at least think it over.

08:43.040 --> 08:43.750
Huh?

08:43.750 --> 08:46.170
No way?! You'd do it for HIM?!

08:46.170 --> 08:49.580
Wait, how is he standing in the same room
as Mikarin and not freaking out?!

08:54.290 --> 08:55.500
Senpai...

08:56.960 --> 08:59.500
D'ya wanna see me cosplay?

09:00.960 --> 09:04.880
I get to see all four members of the squad together?!

09:04.880 --> 09:05.960
Hell yeah!

09:05.960 --> 09:08.710
You're that obsessed with anime girls?!

09:08.710 --> 09:09.630
Then I'm in!

09:09.630 --> 09:10.670
Mikarin?!

09:11.960 --> 09:13.750
This is good and all,
but are you sure?

09:13.750 --> 09:16.750
Fashion models don't usually go to Comiket...

09:16.750 --> 09:21.130
Wait, Mikarin said in an interview that
cosplay is one of her hobbies!

09:21.130 --> 09:21.880
Huh?!

09:22.330 --> 09:25.460
She's been posting cosplay pics to her Insta, too!

09:25.460 --> 09:29.210
Yep! My agency said it's cool for me to cosplay.

09:29.210 --> 09:30.500
Really?!

09:31.080 --> 09:32.580
Well, yeah.

09:33.210 --> 09:36.000
What do you like to do on your days off?

09:36.000 --> 09:37.580
I love to cosplay!

09:37.790 --> 09:40.330
Cosplay? Wow.

09:40.880 --> 09:42.500
For two months,

09:42.500 --> 09:46.210
I've put everything I have into making
it normal for models to cosplay!

09:46.210 --> 09:50.790
Now, it'll be a cinch for me to wear a costume,
and I'm doing it all for one special person...

09:51.380 --> 09:53.920
Did you do that for me?

09:54.250 --> 09:55.420
Girl, no.

09:56.040 --> 10:00.290
Anyways, I'll wear whatever Senpai wants,
just say the word.

10:00.290 --> 10:03.080
We could book a private studio
and take some raunchy pics, too...

10:03.080 --> 10:06.210
You'd do that? Thanks.

10:06.670 --> 10:09.000
Wait, does Mikarin have a thing for Okumura?!

10:09.000 --> 10:11.380
No way, that'd be crazy.

10:11.380 --> 10:14.630
Look how close they are after
so many years of friendship...

10:15.040 --> 10:16.460
That's so cool.

10:17.500 --> 10:18.580
Okay, then!

10:18.580 --> 10:21.710
Let's get started on making the
costumes for Ariel and Miriela!

10:21.710 --> 10:22.880
Yay!

10:23.750 --> 10:25.880
I bought the materials you asked for.

10:25.880 --> 10:27.460
Do you need any for Miriela?

10:27.460 --> 10:29.880
I already got them, boss!

10:30.580 --> 10:33.330
Okay, could you get out the pattern paper?

10:33.330 --> 10:36.210
I'm gonna start with teaching
you how to make your own pattern!

10:37.040 --> 10:38.080
Is this it?

10:38.080 --> 10:41.710
Wait, you're gonna sew, too?
Just let Ririsa do everything.

10:42.250 --> 10:45.630
No way!
Making it by hand will really show my love!

10:45.630 --> 10:48.500
That's why I make all my Valentine's
chocolate and write physical letters, too!

10:48.500 --> 10:54.460
Wait, did Senpai not realize I loved him because
I always gave him super-expensive chocolate?

10:55.750 --> 10:58.080
This cost me ten thousand yen from a fancy hotel.

10:58.080 --> 10:58.960
Cool.

11:03.580 --> 11:06.210
No, that wasn't the problem.

11:07.630 --> 11:10.210
But, I can solve it by doing this next year.

11:10.880 --> 11:13.420
This cost me ten thousand yen from a fancy hotel.

11:19.710 --> 11:22.170
I followed your instructions
and got my measurements.

11:22.790 --> 11:24.710
Are you not gonna do mine?

11:24.710 --> 11:28.290
Nope! I remember all of yours from last time!

11:28.960 --> 11:32.460
Wait, but like, that was back in May.

11:33.630 --> 11:36.500
I could've grown a little since then!

11:36.500 --> 11:40.460
I do all my exercises every day,
and I've been taking supplements!

11:40.460 --> 11:42.130
In just two months, though?

11:43.040 --> 11:43.670
<b>Manga Club</b>

11:43.670 --> 11:46.460
<b>Manga Club</b>

11:43.670 --> 11:46.460
<b>Measurement Time</b>

11:46.460 --> 11:47.170
<b>Manga Club</b>

11:48.460 --> 11:50.710
See? Same numbers as before!

11:50.710 --> 11:52.170
I'll start on your pattern!

11:50.710 --> 11:52.170
But I did the exercises... Why?

11:52.170 --> 11:52.920
But I did the exercises... Why?

11:52.920 --> 11:54.500
I-it's okay...

11:55.000 --> 11:56.540
I feel like we're bonding.

11:57.330 --> 12:01.790
A pattern is made up of each piece of
fabric we're going to cut and sew.

12:01.790 --> 12:07.380
We'll determine the shapes of all the
pieces and how they'll get sewn together.

12:07.380 --> 12:11.290
None of these instructions are in the manga,
so we have to figure it out on our own.

12:13.040 --> 12:19.380
Taking the 2D design and recreating it in
3D is where a cosplayer's skill can really shine!

12:21.670 --> 12:27.210
We can use most of Liliel's pattern to make Ariel,
so just follow along with me!

12:27.210 --> 12:30.330
This is Version 4.6.2!

12:30.330 --> 12:34.790
I added darts to the bust so you
don't have to use a push-up bra anymore!

12:35.460 --> 12:41.630
I also used Mayura's two-layered craft technique
to recreate her "impossible" boot design!

12:43.330 --> 12:45.000
Everything okay?

12:45.000 --> 12:50.500
Nah, like, listening to all these details made
me realize how wrong I was doing it before.

12:50.500 --> 12:53.670
I kinda feel embarrassed I even called that cosplay.

12:53.670 --> 12:55.460
You don't need to feel embarrassed!

12:57.080 --> 12:59.830
This isn't the "right" way to do it, Aria-chan.

12:59.830 --> 13:07.330
I just want you to see how fun it is to
recreate a character you really love!

13:08.210 --> 13:09.790
So just make it about love...

13:10.130 --> 13:14.670
That's right!
What do you like so much about Ariel?

13:14.670 --> 13:15.710
That's easy!

13:15.710 --> 13:20.210
I love how she fights for her friends!
Meria from VB is the same way!

13:21.250 --> 13:23.210
I love girls who care about friendship.

13:23.670 --> 13:28.330
That's why I always want to make
new friends and get to know them!

13:29.710 --> 13:32.000
Wait, so manga is why she turned into a gyaru?!

13:32.000 --> 13:33.710
Can that even happen?

13:34.130 --> 13:38.500
Otaku, gyaru, and delinquents
may all share a common ancestor...

13:35.250 --> 13:38.580
<b>Class Outcasts</b>

13:44.250 --> 13:45.830
That's it, good!

13:47.040 --> 13:48.630
Now connect it up...

13:49.250 --> 13:50.920
You're doing great!

13:50.920 --> 13:52.290
I dunno, really?

13:50.920 --> 13:52.290
Hey, Senpai! Are you listening? Senpai!

13:52.290 --> 13:54.710
The base for your top is finished!

13:52.290 --> 13:54.710
Hey, Senpai! Are you listening? Senpai!

13:54.710 --> 13:56.540
Let's have you try it on

13:54.710 --> 13:56.540
Hey, Senpai! Are you listening? Senpai!

13:56.540 --> 13:58.170
before we sew everything together.

13:56.540 --> 13:58.170
Hey, Senpai! Are you listening? Senpai!

14:08.130 --> 14:10.250
Sorry, I'm slowing things down!

14:10.250 --> 14:12.540
I have nothing to do anyway,
so I'll just head home!

14:13.460 --> 14:16.040
No way! Just chill here, god!

14:16.040 --> 14:16.710
That's right!

14:16.710 --> 14:19.880
Your presence gives us
so much more motivation!

14:20.130 --> 14:22.130
Seriously, what makes him so special?

14:24.290 --> 14:27.290
If you talking is hard for you, I can wait.

14:27.710 --> 14:29.130
He's a good person.

14:29.130 --> 14:31.380
Together, we'll make it happen!

14:31.380 --> 14:36.960
I can kind of imagine what happened.
I'm sure they've had their own moments.

14:38.290 --> 14:41.250
I'm sure he's shown them he's trustworthy.

14:41.250 --> 14:44.880
I'm gonna sit outside and replay
Episode 13 in my head.

14:45.960 --> 14:47.460
Him, though?

14:49.420 --> 14:50.630
<b>Manga Club</b>

14:50.630 --> 14:52.330
<b>Manga Club</b>

14:50.630 --> 14:52.330
<b>Fitting Time</b>

14:55.170 --> 14:57.750
It fits like a glove!

14:58.500 --> 15:00.420
Wait, I'm looking closer,

15:00.420 --> 15:02.540
and it even has the same folds
in the fabric we saw in the anime!

15:03.210 --> 15:05.170
It's hella accurate!

15:05.830 --> 15:08.750
Is anyone gonna notice that tiny detail, though?

15:09.250 --> 15:11.000
What do you think, Senpai?

15:13.460 --> 15:16.250
Whoa, you've got the same fabric folds, too!

15:16.250 --> 15:17.000
Okay, then!

15:19.830 --> 15:21.670
I messed up again!

15:21.670 --> 15:25.250
I keep messing up the stitches
and the pleats are all over the place.

15:25.250 --> 15:27.130
This sucks so bad!

15:27.130 --> 15:30.960
Yeah, pleated skirts are really tough.

15:30.960 --> 15:34.880
And you can't redo stitches on stretch
PVC so it's back to square one...

15:34.880 --> 15:37.130
I'm trapped in stretch PVC hell!

15:35.250 --> 15:37.130
<b>I'm trapped in</b>

15:35.250 --> 15:37.130
<b>stretch PVC hell!</b>

15:38.210 --> 15:41.210
I'm so bad at this. I can't do it right.

15:41.210 --> 15:43.920
I'm like, never gonna be as good as you.

15:44.130 --> 15:45.130
It's okay!

15:45.130 --> 15:47.540
Just keep persevering,
and the pleats will eventually be done!

15:47.540 --> 15:49.170
I don't wanna persevere...

15:50.210 --> 15:53.880
Hey Ririsa, how long do
I have to keep this on for?

15:53.880 --> 15:55.330
I totally forgot!

15:55.880 --> 16:00.670
Senpai left to catch that anime at 6,
so maybe I should head out, too.

16:00.960 --> 16:02.540
I'm hungry!

16:02.540 --> 16:04.460
Wanna grab dinner at a restaurant together?

16:04.460 --> 16:06.420
My mom's gonna be home late.

16:06.420 --> 16:07.420
That sounds great!

16:07.420 --> 16:08.750
Want to come with, Mikari-chan?

16:08.750 --> 16:09.290
Want to come with, Mikari-chan?

16:08.750 --> 16:09.290
Dinner together with friends?!

16:09.290 --> 16:10.880
Sure, I guess.

16:09.290 --> 16:10.880
Dinner together with friends?!

16:10.880 --> 16:13.130
I can check that off my Friend Wishlist!

16:16.630 --> 16:20.380
I love when there's a tablet so
I don't have to talk to the waiter...

16:20.380 --> 16:22.460
W-what do you all want?

16:22.920 --> 16:24.790
What're you getting, Nono-pi?

16:24.790 --> 16:26.420
You don't normally eat that much.

16:26.670 --> 16:31.170
Omu! Omurice!
I can eat an entire plate of omurice by myself!

16:26.670 --> 16:34.330
<b>Beef Stew Omurice</b>

16:31.170 --> 16:34.330
Omurice has saved my life time and time again!

16:34.830 --> 16:36.290
What are you getting, Aria-chan?!

16:37.710 --> 16:40.000
I'm still frustrated from earlier,

16:40.000 --> 16:42.790
so I'm getting tandoori
chicken with Mexican pilaf.

16:42.790 --> 16:44.580
Make that extra pilaf.

16:44.580 --> 16:49.250
That's 1300 Calories... what does she eat in a day?

16:46.880 --> 16:48.540
<b>1300 Calories</b>

16:49.420 --> 16:53.880
I'll have a chicken salad and an acai yogurt.

16:54.540 --> 16:55.880
You're on a model's diet!

16:56.380 --> 16:57.580
How about you, Ririsa-chan?

16:57.580 --> 17:01.250
Oh, I found a super-cheap combo I can order!

17:01.250 --> 17:02.670
You're all about cost!

17:03.130 --> 17:09.330
Evening combo mixed grill with extra rice,
a side of fries, salad and endless drink refills.

17:09.330 --> 17:14.330
Then extra sides of corn potage and bread rolls,
and a jumbo strawberry parfait for dessert!

17:33.920 --> 17:35.420
C-can I order some anmitsu?

17:35.420 --> 17:36.420
She went for it!

17:37.210 --> 17:38.580
I have a question.

17:39.670 --> 17:42.460
Ririsa-chan, you make cosroms, right?

17:42.460 --> 17:47.500
With all our prep for the group cosplay,
are you gonna be able to make a ROM for Comiket?

17:48.830 --> 17:50.920
Or did you not get a spot?

17:51.330 --> 17:52.750
Oh, actually...

17:54.130 --> 17:58.580
When I went to Winter Comiket,
I didn't even grab an application for summer.

17:59.290 --> 18:00.630
Really?

18:05.920 --> 18:08.170
I mean, back then...

18:08.750 --> 18:10.420
Can I get your new Liliel doujin?!

18:11.420 --> 18:16.170
I couldn't have even imagined I'd be here now...

18:18.710 --> 18:23.170
Preparing to go to Summer Comiket
with friends in a group cosplay!

18:24.420 --> 18:26.580
Ririsa-chan was just like me...

18:26.580 --> 18:28.920
F-friends?

18:28.920 --> 18:32.380
I mean, I guess you could call us that.

18:35.460 --> 18:39.330
That's right!
We're going to cosplay together, as friends!

18:40.830 --> 18:44.330
Meria and Ariel fought hard for their friends!

18:46.170 --> 18:47.540
I can't give up!

18:47.540 --> 18:50.580
I'm going to become them,
just like Ririsa does!

18:55.880 --> 18:58.630
I'm going to persevere for my friends!

19:04.500 --> 19:08.330
That's it, that's it!
You're doing perfect so far, Aria-chan!

19:11.790 --> 19:13.960
So... You have to start over again?

19:13.960 --> 19:16.250
Give her a little time to process it emotionally...

19:23.250 --> 19:24.750
You're almost there...

19:25.170 --> 19:27.670
That's right.
Stop the needle...

19:29.580 --> 19:33.960
I'm done! With just the skirt, but still!

19:34.830 --> 19:37.630
Aria-chan, you did so good!

19:37.630 --> 19:41.460
Great job!
You've really been putting in effort!

19:41.920 --> 19:43.130
I gotta try it on!

19:43.130 --> 19:45.670
Aria-chan, Okumura-senpai is-

19:49.960 --> 19:50.960
Gone!

19:51.170 --> 19:56.460
<b>Manga Club</b>

19:51.580 --> 19:52.500
Your eyes are rather slow.

19:52.500 --> 19:56.130
He left faster than the speed of sound...
Like a true hero.

20:41.830 --> 20:42.880
It's perfect!

20:42.880 --> 20:44.830
Okay, where's mine?

20:44.830 --> 20:48.540
Don't worry! I've been working on it at home!

20:48.540 --> 20:51.460
What?! When the hell do you sleep?!

20:53.210 --> 20:55.210
Gotta get that fabric...

20:56.710 --> 20:57.920
Never mind.

20:58.250 --> 20:59.540
Nono-pi, how do I look?

20:59.540 --> 21:02.750
Really good! This part looks great!
How'd you manage it?

20:59.960 --> 21:04.880
<b>Manga Club</b>

21:02.750 --> 21:04.380
A lot of sweat, blood, and tears!

21:05.960 --> 21:07.830
Okay, see you later, girls!

21:07.830 --> 21:11.500
Tomorrow, we start putting on the finishing touches!

21:55.330 --> 21:56.580
I'm home!

21:59.670 --> 22:01.130
Kisaki residence, who's calling?

22:01.130 --> 22:02.330
She's on the phone?

22:02.330 --> 22:03.580
My mother-in-law? Please.

22:04.420 --> 22:05.750
Dad's mom called?!

22:06.380 --> 22:10.420
We haven't been family for a long time.
What do you want?

22:12.210 --> 22:14.380
Look, it doesn't matter...

22:14.960 --> 22:16.880
He died years ago.

23:55.960 --> 24:00.420
<b>Destiny</b>
